{
  "info": {
    "name": "ExchangeService - API Tests",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for testing ExchangeService endpoints. Based on API contract, integration tests and spec requirements. Base URL: http://localhost:8080\n\nKey notes:\n- POST /transactions returns 202 with status PENDING (async settlement). usd_rate/amount_usd/limit_exceeded may be null initially.\n- Transaction currency normalized to uppercase; category normalized.\n- Default monthly limit is 1000 USD (for pair account+category) when no explicit limit installed; shown with limit_id null and limit_datetime = start of month (UTC).\n- limit_exceeded is cumulative over the month up to and including current transaction.\n- GET /limits returns newest limits first.\n- Errors use application/problem+json (RFC 9457) with type like https://exchangeservice.example.com/problems/...",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accountFrom",
      "value": "0000000123",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accountTo",
      "value": "0000009999",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accountOther",
      "value": "0000000777",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "transactionId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Transactions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/v1/transactions - Accept (202, PENDING)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"account_from\": \"{{accountFrom}}\",\n  \"account_to\": \"{{accountTo}}\",\n  \"currency_shortname\": \"USD\",\n  \"sum\": 1000.00,\n  \"expense_category\": \"product\",\n  \"datetime\": \"2022-01-02T10:00:00Z\",\n  \"transaction_id\": \"{{$guid}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "transactions"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 202) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('transactionId', json.transaction_id);",
                  "    console.log('Saved transaction_id:', json.transaction_id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/v1/transactions - No transaction_id (auto)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
